<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Feb trade surplus 10.7 billion crowns.</title>
<headline>Swedish Feb trade surplus 10.7 billion crowns.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's February trade surplus was 10.7 billion crowns, for a year-on-year surplus of 119.5 billion crowns, Statistics Sweden said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p> SWEDISH TRADE BALANCE     Feb 97     Jan 97     Feb 96</p>
<p> Exports			 48.8	 47.1	 47.4</p>
<p> Imports			 38.1	 37.5	 37.8</p>
<p> Trade balance		+10.7	 +9.6	 +9.6</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of crowns. Analysts polled by Reuters had forecast a 10 billion crown surplus.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
